{"title":"Slow Tuesday, Sea Breeze and Noodles","summary":"A late, easy day around An Bang and the nearby lanes, with a beach stroll, a temple pause and two unhurried local meals.","stops":[{"poi_id":"p8","kind":"activity","must_do_id":null,"note":"A slow morning deserves soft sand and a long look at the water. No rush, just the sea doing its thing."},{"poi_id":"p92","kind":"activity","must_do_id":null,"note":"A quiet temple stop to let the day settle in, close to the beach and easy on the legs."},{"poi_id":"p13","kind":"meal","must_do_id":null,"note":"Lunch that tastes like a local kitchen, not a timetable. Chicken rice, warm and filling."},{"poi_id":"p16","kind":"activity","must_do_id":null,"note":"A little green pause between meals, where the afternoon moves at walking speed."},{"poi_id":"p19","kind":"meal","must_do_id":null,"note":"Dinner of soft rice cakes, the kind of street food that makes you say ngon quá (so tasty) quietly to yourself."}]}
